{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wangwei-e-0e4bee2bb1fa214b8365","title":"傅嘏难刘劭考课论","accounts":[{"id":"wangwei-a-0e4bee2bb1fa214b8365","label":"正文","text":"傅嘏难刘劭考课论","evidence":["wangwei-q-1d839a4edad618c08f47","wangwei-q-7859a84f9e9a80eebe6d","wangwei-q-b3948054456e9a02124b","wangwei-q-235d6dfae60a97bbd844"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xunyu-p0063","role":"撰难论者","evidence":["wangwei-q-1d839a4edad618c08f47","wangwei-q-7859a84f9e9a80eebe6d","wangwei-q-b3948054456e9a02124b","wangwei-q-235d6dfae60a97bbd844"]},{"person":"huanchen-p0003","role":"被难考课论作者","evidence":["wangwei-q-1d839a4edad618c08f47","wangwei-q-7859a84f9e9a80eebe6d","wangwei-q-b3948054456e9a02124b","wangwei-q-235d6dfae60a97bbd844"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wangwei-q-1d839a4edad618c08f47","wangwei-q-7859a84f9e9a80eebe6d","wangwei-q-b3948054456e9a02124b","wangwei-q-235d6dfae60a97bbd844"]},"ordering_evidence":"wangwei-q-1d839a4edad618c08f47","order":4426}],"persons":[{"id":"huanchen-p0003","name":"刘劭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xunyu-p0063","name":"傅嘏","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wangwei-q-1d839a4edad618c08f47","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-e374736b8c99de8c67f0","layer":"original","quote":"时散骑常侍刘劭作《考课法》，事下三府〖5〗。嘏难劭论曰〖6〗：","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":422,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-235d6dfae60a97bbd844","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-5eac5c7994b5c57f5334","layer":"original","quote":"昔先王之择才〖38〗，必本行于州闾〖39〗，讲道于庠序〖40〗；行具而谓之贤，道修则谓之能。乡老献贤能于王〖41〗，王拜受之：举其贤者，“出使长之〖42〗”；科其能者，“入使治之”。此先王收才之义也。方今九州之民〖43〗，爰及京城，未有六乡之举；其选才之职，专任吏部〖44〗。按品、状〖45〗，则实才未必当；任（薄）〔簿〕伐，则德行未为叙〖46〗。如此则殿最之课〖47〗，未尽人才。述综王度〖48〗，敷赞国式〖49〗；体深义广，难得而详也。","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":220,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-7859a84f9e9a80eebe6d","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-4703372a524fd2d7cfdf","layer":"original","quote":"盖闻帝制宏深，圣道奥远；苟非其才，则道不虚行；神而明之，存乎其人。暨乎王略亏颓，而旷载罔缀〖7〗；微言既没〖8〗，六籍泯玷〖9〗。何则？道弘致远而众才莫晞也〖10〗。案劭《考课》论，虽欲寻前代黜陟之文〖11〗，然其制度略已阙亡〖12〗。礼之存者，惟有周典〖13〗：外建侯伯〖14〗，藩屏九服〖15〗；内立列司〖16〗，管齐六职〖17〗；土有恒贡，官有定则；百揆均任〖18〗，四民殊业〖19〗。故考绩可理而黜陟易通也〖20〗。","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":423,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":212,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-b3948054456e9a02124b","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-0a9703610a35d3f6a100","layer":"original","quote":"大魏继百王之末〖21〗，承秦、汉之烈〖22〗，制度之流，靡所修采〖23〗。自建安以来，至于青龙〖24〗；神武拨乱〖25〗，肇基皇祚〖26〗；扫除凶逆，芟夷遗寇；旌旗卷舒〖27〗，日不暇给〖28〗。及经邦治戎〖29〗，权法并用〖30〗；百官群司，军国通任；随时之宜，以应政机。以古施今〖31〗，事杂义殊〖32〗，难得而通也。所以然者，制宜经远〖33〗，或不切近；法应时务，不足垂后。夫建官均职，清理民物〖34〗，所以立本也；循名考实，纠励成规〖35〗，所以治末也。本纲未举而造制（未呈）〔末程〕〖36〗，国略不崇而考课是先〖37〗；惧不足以料贤愚之分，精幽明之理也。","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":424,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":282,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
